## The examples, all at once

`scripts/build_examples.py` builds each example for the web, then runs its test and captures its poster
(see [example 3](../../01_tutorial/04_cgp/index.html#how-the-cgp-examples-are-built)); `--no-test` skips the test.

## The bridge

The C++ bridge has its unit tests, with the address and undefined-behavior sanitizers:

```
make test
```

from the root of the repository ([tests/test_slide_bridge.cpp](../../code/tests/test_slide_bridge.cpp)).
